      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 776,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Jesus said to him in reply, 'What do you want me to do for you?' The blind man replied to him, 'Master, I want to see.'…”",
      "words": 26,
      "chars": 122,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 1041,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“I, then, a prisoner for the Lord, urge you to live in a manner worthy of the call you have received, with all humility…”",
      "words": 24,
      "chars": 121,
      "lines": 4,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 1306,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“I have come to set the earth on fire, and how I wish it were already blazing!”",
      "words": 17,
      "chars": 79,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 1602,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“You also must be prepared, for at an hour you do not expect, the Son of Man will come.”",
      "words": 19,
      "chars": 88,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 1861,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Take care to guard against all greed, for though one may be rich, one’s life does not consist of possessions.”",
      "words": 20,
      "chars": 111,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 2152,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“For the Son of Man did not come to be served but to serve and to give his life as a ransom for many.”",
      "words": 24,
      "chars": 102,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 2417,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Are not five sparrows sold for two small coins? Yet not one of them has escaped the notice of God. Even the hairs of…”",
      "words": 24,
      "chars": 119,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 2682,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Whoever drinks the water I shall give will never thirst; the water I shall give will become in him a spring of water…”",
      "words": 23,
      "chars": 119,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 2973,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“In contrast, the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, patience, kindness, generosity, faithfulness, gentleness,…”",
      "words": 16,
      "chars": 118,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 3238,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Jesus, looking at him, loved him and said to him, 'You are lacking in one thing. Go, sell what you have, and give to the…”",
      "words": 25,
      "chars": 123,
      "lines": 4,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 3503,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“He replied, 'Rather, blessed are those who hear the word of God and observe it.”",
      "words": 15,
      "chars": 81,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 3824,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Mary said, 'Behold, I am the handmaid of the Lord. May it be done to me according to your word.”",
      "words": 20,
      "chars": 97,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 4089,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Which of these three, in your opinion, was neighbor to the robbers' victim? He answered, 'The one who treated him with…”",
      "words": 21,
      "chars": 121,
      "lines": 4,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 4355,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Nevertheless, do not rejoice because the spirits are subject to you, but rejoice because your names are written in…”",
      "words": 19,
      "chars": 117,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 4676,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“See that you do not despise one of these little ones, for I say to you that their angels in heaven always look upon the…”",
      "words": 25,
      "chars": 122,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 4941,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Amen, I say to you, unless you turn and become like children, you will not enter the kingdom of heaven.”",
      "words": 20,
      "chars": 105,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 5232,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“All Scripture is inspired by God and profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, and for training in…”",
      "words": 18,
      "chars": 113,
      "lines": 3,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 5522,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Whoever receives this child in my name receives me, and whoever receives me receives the one who sent me. For the one…”",
      "words": 22,
      "chars": 120,
      "lines": 4,
      "size": 24,
      "vw": 6.2,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.3,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 5788,
      "tag": "span",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "Ad Maiorem Dei Gloriam",
      "words": 4,
      "chars": 22,
      "lines": 1,
      "size": 26,
      "vw": 6.7,
      "font": "Cormorant Garamond",
      "weight": 500,
      "tracking": -0.01,
      "leading": 1.47,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": true,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "left",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6119,
      "tag": "p",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "A new scripture, reflection and prayer every morning.",
      "words": 8,
